  "solution": "<ol class=\"alpha-list\"><li>Ta có <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Tam giác <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow></semantics></math> vuông tại <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mi>A</mi></semantics></math> nên <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi><msup><mi>C</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>A</mi><msup><mi>B</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>A</mi><msup><mi>C</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mi>A</mi><msup><mi>B</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>A</mi><msup><mi>B</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></semantics></math>.</li><li>Vì chu vi của tam giác <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow></semantics></math> là <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mn>24</mn></semantics></math> cm nên <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>24</mn><mi>.</mi></mrow></semantics></math><br>Đặt <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></mrow></semantics></math>, suy ra <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>2</mn><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mo>+</mo><msqrt><mrow><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></msqrt><mo>=</mo><mn>24</mn><mo>⇔</mo><msqrt><mrow><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn></mrow></msqrt><mo>=</mo><mn>22</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi></mrow></semantics></math>.<br>Bình phương hai vế phương trình, ta được\n\t\t\t<div class=\"math-display\"><math display=\"block\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>4</mn><mo>=</mo><msup><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">(</mo><mn>22</mn><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"postfix\">)</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>⇔</mo><mn>2</mn><msup><mi>x</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>−</mo><mn>92</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>480</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>⇔</mo><mrow><mo stretchy=\"true\" form=\"prefix\">[</mo><mtable><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right\"/><mtd columnalign=\"left\" style=\"text-align: left\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>40</mn></mtd></mtr><mtr><mtd columnalign=\"right\" style=\"text-align: right\"/><mtd columnalign=\"left\" style=\"text-align: left\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn><mi>.</mi></mtd></mtr></mtable></mrow></mrow></semantics></math></div>\n\t\t\tThay vào phương trình ban đầu, ta thấy <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></semantics></math> thoả mãn.<br>Do đó <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>B</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>6</mn></mrow></semantics></math> cm, <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>A</mi><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow></semantics></math> cm và <math display=\"inline\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>B</mi><mi>C</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>10</mn></mrow></semantics></math> cm.</li></ol>",
